  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strenghtening Madagascar&apos;s anticorruption institutions</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main objective of the project (impact) is to reduce corruption in Madagascar. This is to be achieved through the strengthening the effectiveness of the anti-corruption bureau (BIANCO) and the dedicated legal entity to prosecute corruption cases ( PAC), as well as support to Civil Society Organizations.</narrative>
  </description>
